# Corpus and eval text: LF on every platform. Chunk counts and document ids
# depend on the exact text, and CRLF (git's default checkout on Windows)
# adds tokens: the Phase 3 corpus counted 303 chunks on a Windows checkout
# against 284 with LF. The loader also normalises line endings, as a second
# guard.
kb/** text eol=lf
backend/eval/*.json text eol=lf
backend/eval/enterprise/** text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
